<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>Pointer&lt;ExampleObject&gt;<sp/>rc_other<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">new</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ExampleObject(data);</highlight></codeline>
