<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>have<sp/>two<sp/>pointers<sp/>point<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>object</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>Pointer&lt;ExampleObject&gt;<sp/>rc2<sp/>=<sp/>rc;</highlight></codeline>
