<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>the<sp/>object<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>deleted<sp/>on<sp/>exit</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
